                        ))}
                    </div>
                </section>

                <section class="guide-sources">
                    <p class="guide-eyebrow">Sources and further reading</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li><a href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Python docs: logging (levels, propagate, basicConfig, lastResort)</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://docs.python.org/3/howto/logging.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Python docs: Logging HOWTO</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://docs.python.org/3/library/logging.config.html" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Python docs: logging.config and the dictConfig schema</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://opentelemetry.io/docs/specs/otel/logs/data-model/#field-severitynumber" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OpenTelemetry: log data model, SeverityNumber</a></li>
                        <li><a href="https://pypi.org/project/opentelemetry-instrumentation-logging/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">PyPI: opentelemetry-instrumentation-logging</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/guides/instrumentation-python">Maple docs: Python instrumentation</a></li>
                        <li><a href="/docs/explore/logs">Maple docs: Logs</a></li>
                    </ul>
                </section>
            </article>
        </div>
    </main>

